      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-12-26T21:43:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>1) It does not apply. All Presence track options are taken in the spirit phase and Unrelenting Growth uncovers the track in the fast powers phase.</p>\n<p>2) It would not ravage. The event is changing the ravage step,and so you only check at this stage.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
