      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>1) It does not apply. All Presence track options are taken in the spirit phase and Unrelenting Growth uncovers the track in the fast powers phase.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2) It would not ravage. The event is changing the ravage step,and so you only check at this stage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
