      "created_at": "2019-12-26T21:46:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Paul, on (1) you misunderstood the question: Unrelenting Growth lets you place Presence outside of the Growth phase. In fact you can use that element for the threshold:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.7w4g8rf\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.7w4g8rf</a></p>\n<p>EDIT: Actually, that FAQ is a slightly different question. The threshold question is answered here:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.9v5kcmx\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.9v5kcmx</a></p>\n<p>On (2), that's correct, you check what's there at the time the Ravage happens.</p>",
